<p>You breathe a wave of dead maggots in a cone of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym> Any target caught in the area will take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">168, 217, 254, 285, 311</acronym> blight damage and be infected with a crippling disease for 10 turns.</p><p>Crippling disease slows creatures by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9%, 24%, 34%, 40%, 44%</acronym> and deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">13, 16, 19, 21, 23</acronym> blight damage per turn.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Magic, and the critical chance is based on your Spell crit rate.</p>